<%~ await includeAsync('./inc/header', firekylin) %><% const site=await firekylin.widget('Widget_Options'); const c=site.themeConfig || {}; const a=await firekylin.widget('Widget_Archive',{type:'index'}); %>
<% if(!a.is('tag') && !a.is('cate')) { %><section class="mdl-card daily-pic mdl-cell mdl-cell--8-col index-top-block"><div class="mdl-card__media mdl-color-text--grey-50 daily-media"><% if(c.dailypic) { %><img class="daily-image" src="<%= c.dailypic %>" alt=""><% } %><p class="index-top-block-slogan"><%= c.slogan || site.description() || site.title() %></p></div><div class="mdl-card__supporting-text meta"><% if(c.avatarURL) { %><img class="avatar" src="<%= c.avatarURL %>" alt=""><% } %><%= site.title() %></div></section>
<section class="mdl-card something-else mdl-cell mdl-cell--8-col mdl-cell--4-col-desktop index-top-block"><a class="search-fab" href="/search.html" aria-label="搜索">⌕</a><div class="something-else-logo"><% if(c.logo) { %><img src="<%= c.logo %>" alt="<%= site.title() %>"><% } else { %><span class="material-mark" aria-hidden="true">M</span><% } %></div><div class="mdl-card__supporting-text meta meta--fill"><strong><%= site.title() %></strong><span class="section-spacer"></span><a href="/archives" aria-label="归档">▦</a><a href="/rss.html">RSS</a></div></section><% } else { %><h1 class="mdl-cell mdl-cell--12-col"><%= a.archiveTitle %></h1><% } %>
<%~ await includeAsync('./inc/list', {...firekylin,archive:a}) %><%~ await includeAsync('./inc/footer',firekylin) %>